Description: cache purge and cache-tag module for Nginx
 ngx_cache_pilot adds purge support for the FastCGI, proxy, SCGI, and uWSGI
 caches in Nginx. It also adds Linux-backed cache-key and cache-tag indexing
 for faster invalidation flows.
 .
 This package ships ngx_cache_pilot as a dynamic Nginx module and depends on
 the matching nginx ABI provided by the target distribution.
